  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Eragrostis ciliaris",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_ciliaris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1325540341,
      "text": "Eragrostis ciliaris, the gophertail lovegrass, is a species of grass. It is native to the Old World Tropics; nearly all of Africa, Madagascar, other Indian Ocean islands, the Arabian Peninsula, the Indian Subcontinent, Myanmar, Vietnam, Taiwan and the Philippines and a number of Pacific islands, and has been introduced to the New World Tropics and Subtropics, from the southern United States to Argentina, the Caribbean, and other Pacific islands. Its seeds are edible and nutritious, but quite small and difficult to harvest and handle, so it is usually regarded as a famine food."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Capim-de-rola",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capim-de-rola",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 72161886,
      "text": "O capim-de-rola, também conhecido popularmente como capim-pelo-de-rato, capim-mimoso, capim-bosta-de-rola, capim-de-canário, capim-de-rato, capim-fino ou capim-penacho, é uma espécie de gramínea da família Poaceae, nativa dos trópicos do Velho Mundo, ocorrendo em quase toda a África, em Madagascar, em outras ilhas do Oceano Índico, na Península Arábica, no subcontinente indiano, em Mianmar, Vietnã, Taiwan e Filipinas, além de diversas ilhas do Pacífico."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Eragrostis ciliaris",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_ciliaris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29438732,
      "text": "Eragrostis ciliaris, yang dikenal sebagai gophertail lovegrass, adalah spesies rumput. Spesies ini merupakan tanaman asli daerah tropis Dunia Lama; hampir seluruh Afrika, Madagaskar, pulau-pulau lain di Samudra Hindia, Semenanjung Arab, Anak Benua India, Myanmar, Vietnam, Taiwan, dan Filipina, serta sejumlah pulau di Pasifik. Tanaman ini juga telah diperkenalkan ke daerah tropis dan subtropis Dunia Baru, dari Amerika Serikat bagian selatan hingga Argentina, Karibia, dan pulau-pulau Pasifik lainnya."
    }
  },
